  "notes": "Label is used to provide a name or title for an input field. Label can be placed before or after the field.\n\nNeeds daisyUI installed (npm i -D daisyui, then @plugin \"daisyui\" in your CSS).\n\nOriginal file: https://github.com/saadeghi/daisyui/blob/master/packages/docs/src/routes/(routes)/components/label/+page.md",
